161             dangerous_files (`list[str]`, optional):
162                 Sensitive files that require explicit user confirmation,
163                 even in BYPASS mode. Matched by basename
164                 (case-insensitive). Defaults to `DEFAULT_DANGEROUS_FILES`.
165                 Pass a custom list to fully replace the defaults, or `[]`
166                 to disable the filename check.
167             dangerous_directories (`list[str]`, optional):
